      "writtenOn": "2026-09-09T06:47:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Should we not make onBrokerApiStarted() idempotent to avoid that?\n\nThat\u0027s an interesting point: what happens if we start, stop and then start an events-broker implementation again? Do we receive the same messages twice? I don\u0027t believe we should because we are using the same group IDs.",
      "parentUuid": "9bde9915_24f75bb9",
